# Terraform working state. A .tfplan is a serialised plan: it embeds resource
# attributes, and for anything reading a secret it embeds the value. Never
# commit one. .terraform/ is provider binaries and a cached backend config
# carrying the state bucket and role.
.terraform/
*.tfplan
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

